{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"main_16_level_spst_16-02","storyGroup":"main_16","storySort":258,"storyDependence":"main_16_level_spst_16-02","storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":"EG-8","storyName":"往事","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"一座沉没的城市重见天日，一盏废弃的矿灯再度亮起。这年头太怪，什么事都有可能发生。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"obt/main/level_spst_16-02","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"spst_16-02","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":21,"next":23,"characters":["胆小的矿工","忧虑的矿工","病重的矿工","卫兵","怀疑的矿工","恐慌的矿工","集团军士官","惊恐的矿工","勤奋的矿工","青年工匠","卡谢娜"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_bg_66_g5_deepmine.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":7},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":9},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_openftstpwalk","volume":"1","id":10},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1969_1#1$1","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":11},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胆小的矿工","text":"轰炸……轰炸停了。","id":12,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1969_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胆小的矿工","text":"我们、我们走吧，好吗？不是到地上去，而是继续从下面走，趁那些炸弹还没炸到咱们这儿来——","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1969_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":14},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"0.6","id":15},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1970_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,-50","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":16},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":17},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1970_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"……起来，尤里，还有其他人。我们得去找雷尔金，还有他说的那个地方。","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"我们的兄弟姊妹里，勇敢的那些都跟雷尔金去占领岗哨了。","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"现在轰炸停了，上面不知道是什么情况。要是还想见到他们，就只能上去。","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"去帮他们，或者像雷尔金说的那样，去记住他们。走不动的就用手，用矿镐，爬也要爬上去。","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1969_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胆小的矿工","text":"可雷尔金把他的矿灯托付给我们——","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1969_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1970_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"那你记得他说了什么吗？","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1969_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胆小的矿工","text":"他……他什么也没说……","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1969_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1970_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"这就是了，他什么也没说。这和他们留下的那些物资没什么区别，只是一份保障。","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"我们也可以选择把它留在这里，就像……一个提醒。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"对，提醒。把矿灯放进矿车里吧，就是我们来时一路推着的那辆。","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":33},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"……如果有人会来……","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"尤里，我记得你会写字。","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":37},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_papertear","volume":"1","id":38},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"这本工作日志后面是空白的，不用白不用。","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"来。我说，你写。","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"这样，如果有人来，他们至少会知道这里发生过什么。","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":43},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":44},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":45},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":46},{"type":"charslot","id":47},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_bg_bg_iceforest_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":48},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$suspenseful_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_suspenseful_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":49,"musicid":1},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":50},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":51},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":52},{"type":"animtext","id":53,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_both","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>乌萨斯北原，某矿场</><p=2>1101年冬</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":54},{"type":"animtextclean","id":55},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":56},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowbootwalk","volume":"1","id":57},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_094","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":58},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"病重的矿工","text":"大……大人，我们这是……要去哪儿？","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_094.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"病重的矿工","text":"这好像不是回厂里的方向——","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_094.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_082","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卫兵","text":"闭嘴，继续往前走。","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_082.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卫兵","text":"快走！","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_082.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1969_1#1$1","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"怀疑的矿工","text":"（小声）矿场又停工了。","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1969_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"怀疑的矿工","text":"（小声）挖不出来东西……加工厂里就没有原材料。","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1969_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"怀疑的矿工","text":"（小声）如果上面用不上这么多人手了，我们会被带去哪儿？","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1969_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1970_1#1$1","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恐慌的矿工","text":"连病得最重的那几个都被赶起来了，半个矿场的人都在这儿……","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恐慌的矿工","text":"我不想走了。我不想死！","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1969_1#1$1","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"怀疑的矿工","text":"（小声）小点声！","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1969_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1978_1#1$1","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"集团军士官","text":"……","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_1978_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"集团军士官","text":"穿过树林，去湖边。那里，是你们的墓地。","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_1978_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"集团军士官","text":"在抵达之前，不要妄想……","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_1978_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"集团军士官","text":"自己能够逃走。","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_1978_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":80},{"type":"charslot","id":81},{"type":"text","text":"深林中，不断有厚重的军靴踩在雪地上，前进着，也催促着。","id":82},{"type":"text","text":"矿工们的“护送者”远不止队伍前面这几位。","id":83},{"type":"dialog","id":84},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.2","fadetime":"2","id":85},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":86},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":87},{"type":"charslot","id":88},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_bg_bg_snow_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":89},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":90},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"2","id":91},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":92},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":93},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowbootwalk","volume":"1","id":94},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1978_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":95},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"集团军士官","text":"就到这里，停下。","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_1978_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"集团军士官","text":"开始吧。","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_1978_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_082","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卫兵","text":"所有人都站到冰面上去。","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_082.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1970_1#1$1","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恐慌的矿工","text":"不，老爷，我不想——","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":103},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":104},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":105},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"1","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":106},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_broadswordblood","volume":"1","text":"","id":107},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":108},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-50","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.5","id":109},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown2","id":110},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":111},{"type":"charslot","id":112},{"type":"text","text":"军刀将她的话语和脖颈一起割断，血液带着热气喷溅在军人的盔甲上。","id":113},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1978_1#1$1","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"集团军士官","text":"为了乌萨斯的荣光。","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_1978_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_094","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"病重的矿工","text":"天……天哪……","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_094.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1978_1#1$1","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"集团军士官","text":"继续。","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_1978_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_082","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卫兵","text":"后、后面的人，赶紧补上她的空位，快点！","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_082.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":122},{"type":"charslot","id":123},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_surfacefrozen","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"sur","id":124},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"sur","fadetime":"2","id":125},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":126},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1969_1#1$1","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"怀疑的矿工","text":"……我们为什么要遭受这样的对待？","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1969_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_082","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卫兵","text":"别*乌萨斯粗口*废话——","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_082.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1969_1#1$1","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"怀疑的矿工","text":"难道陛下的承诺都是假的吗？我们的命还不如一只驮兽有分量吗？","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1969_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"怀疑的矿工","text":"告诉我——","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1969_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1978_1#1$1","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"集团军士官","text":"……","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_1978_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":136},{"type":"text","text":"在军人再度抬手的瞬间，地面的震颤也终于能够为人所感知。","id":137},{"type":"text","text":"起先只是细微的断裂，来自湖面，来自地下，而后是如骨牌倒塌一般的连锁反应。","id":138},{"type":"dialog","id":139},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"e","id":140},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"4","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"90","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":141},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"e","fadetime":"6","id":142},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_surfacefrozen","volume":"1","id":143},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":144},{"type":"text","text":"大地颤动，湖心塌陷，逐日累积的地形变化终于引起质变。它吞噬冰面上的感染者，也吞噬即将对他们行刑的刽子手。","id":145},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1969_1#1$1","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"怀疑的矿工","text":"跑——快跑！！","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1969_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":148},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowrun","volume":"1","id":149},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.5","id":150},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":151},{"type":"charslot","id":152},{"type":"text","text":"趁卫兵也怔住的时机，矿工甩开对方的钳制，往来时的方向跑去。","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惊恐的矿工","text":"天灾——","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惊恐的矿工","text":"是天灾！！","id":155},{"type":"dialog","id":156},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":157},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_thunders_amb","volume":"0.4","id":158},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":159},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":160},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":161},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":162},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":163},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"e","id":164},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"4","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"90","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":165},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"e","fadetime":"6","id":166},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_spirlstrsndlss","volume":"1","id":167},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rockfall","volume":"1","id":168},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":169},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":170},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":171},{"type":"charslot","id":172},{"type":"text","text":"士兵，矿工；加害者，受害者。广阔的安加拉湖包容了所有，又送出所有。","id":173},{"type":"text","text":"塌陷的冰面之下，一座古老的移动城市随地形的变化骤然上升，冲破冰封，终于得以重见天日。","id":174},{"type":"text","text":"而在那上面……旧时式样的建筑群、死者相貌狰狞的尸骨，都仍保留着它们沉入水底时的模样。","id":175},{"type":"dialog","id":176},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_bg_34_g10_tent_inside.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":177},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":178},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":179},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":180},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":181,"musicid":2},{"type":"animtext","id":182,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_only_heavy","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>乌萨斯远北，灾后重建区域</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":183},{"type":"animtextclean","id":184},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"勤奋的矿工","text":"“北原”……“天灾”……“湖”……","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"勤奋的矿工","text":"这么小块地方，这么多词，我就认识三个。","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"青年工匠","text":"慢慢来，你总会都认识的。","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"青年工匠","text":"这里的课程对我来说太基础了。现在矿井没人照管，我打算把活计接过来，再想办法去学门修鞋以外的手艺。","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"青年工匠","text":"等戒严解除，我要去圣骏堡。","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"勤奋的矿工","text":"我不想去圣骏堡，我只想读书。每天学会三个词，一周就是二十一个，一个月就是……","id":191},{"type":"dialog","id":192},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_highheelfts","volume":"1","id":193},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_415_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":194},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡谢娜","text":"我很高兴看到你们始终怀有一颗向上的心。","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_415_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡谢娜","text":"需要我的帮助吗？","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_415_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"勤奋的矿工","text":"这些词，女士，它们还是让我糊涂。","id":199},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_415_1#1$1","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡谢娜","text":"相信你说的是这些“名词”，对吗？因为这是我们这周的课程——“认识名词”。","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_415_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"勤奋的矿工","text":"“名词”——对，名词！我好像已经能分辨出来了，但没办法把它们的意思都对上号。","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"勤奋的矿工","text":"比如这个……“噻门刻”……是什么意思？","id":204},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_415_1#1$1","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡谢娜","text":"哦……","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_415_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡谢娜","text":"它读作“塞梦珂”。就像上一行里的湖叫“安加拉”，也像你叫“沃瓦”一样，它只是一个名字。","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_415_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡谢娜","text":"一座移动城市的名字。","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_415_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":209},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":210},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":211},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":212},{"type":"charslot","id":213},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_bg_66_g5_deepmine.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":214},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_energywell","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"en","id":215},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.8","channel":"en","fadetime":"2","id":216},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":217},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":218},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":219},{"type":"text","text":"告别了同伴，青年下到矿井里，准备开始工作。","id":220},{"type":"text","text":"矿道无人维护就会损坏，矿井无人照管就可能会发生塌方。至少在他离开这里之前，他不会允许以上两件事情发生。","id":221},{"type":"text","text":"青年举着矿灯，开始了巡逻。他仔细地查看所有轨道，直到发现一辆明显不属于这里的矿车，出现在其中一条岔路上。","id":222},{"type":"dialog","id":223},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_openftstpwalk","volume":"1","id":224},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"青年工匠","text":"……这是……","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"青年工匠","text":"矿灯？","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"青年工匠","text":"还有一封信——","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"青年工匠","text":"……","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"青年工匠","text":"一场抗争……曾在这里酝酿？","id":230},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"青年工匠","text":"天哪。提出矿区互联的人来过这里！他们想占领那个有驻军的岗哨！","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"青年工匠","text":"我就知道，那不是凭空捏造……","id":233},{"type":"dialog","id":234},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.2","channel":"en","fadetime":"2","id":235},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":236},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":237},{"type":"charslot","id":238},{"type":"background","id":239},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/20/Avg_66_i20.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.05","yScale":"1.05","fadetime":"0","id":240},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.05","yScaleFrom":"1.05","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"20","block":"false","id":241},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cndlbrn","volume":"1","id":242},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_churchfire","loop":"true","channel":"a","volume":"0","id":243},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.2","fadetime":"2","channel":"a","id":244},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":245},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"青年工匠","text":"呼……","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"青年工匠","text":"无论这是谁的灯，它都被保存得很好，还能点亮，只是落了些灰……","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"青年工匠","text":"也许我应该把它带走，带去圣骏堡——","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"青年工匠","text":"……然后让所有人瞧瞧……","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"青年工匠","text":"这盏没有名字的矿灯，和那些没有名字的人。","id":251},{"type":"dialog","id":252},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"en","fadetime":"2","id":253},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"2","id":254},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":255},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":256},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":257},{"type":"charslot","id":258},{"type":"background","id":259},{"type":"image","id":260}],"characters":["胆小的矿工","忧虑的矿工","病重的矿工","卫兵","怀疑的矿工","恐慌的矿工","集团军士官","惊恐的矿工","勤奋的矿工","青年工匠","卡谢娜"]}